  funding-text = {We gratefully acknowledge the continuous support by all members of the Engineering and Infrastructure group of IMK-AAF, in particular Olga Dombrowski, Rainer Buschbacher, Tomasz Chudy, Steffen Vogt, and Georg Scheurig. We thank Luis Ladino and Gregory Schill for providing the data shown in Figures 5 and 7. The work has been funded by the Helmholtz-Gemeinschaft Deutscher Forschungszentren as part of the program ``Atmosphere and Climate{''} and by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG) as part of the Ice Nuclei Research Unit INUIT (FOR 1525, project MO 668/42). Newly derived heterogeneous ice nucleation data for the investigated aerosol samples (nucleation onsets and INAS densities, as displayed in Figures 5, 7, and 8) are provided in Tables 2 and 3 of the manuscript. Ice nucleation data and parameters of the individual AIDA ice nucleation experiments are transferred to the INUIT database (https://imk-aaf-s1.imk-aaf.kit.edu:8081/inuit/), which can be managed via the free, web-based database client MyWebSQL (https://sourceforge.net/projects/mywebsql/). Access information is provided through IT administration of IMK-AAF (frank.schwarz@kit.edu) or the Central Coordination and Administration of the INUIT research unit following registration (inuit@iau.uni-frankfurt.de).},
